itical structures, and daily life of the ancient Egyptians.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Further Breakthroughs in Decipherment\",\n      \"type\": \"Scientific Progress\",\n      \"description\": \"The success in deciphering the Rosetta Stone led to further advancements in the study of other ancient writing systems, such as cuneiform, Linear B, and Mayan hieroglyphs.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    }\n  ],\n  \"relations\": [\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Deciphered By\",\n      \"Jean-François Champollion\",\n      \"Champollion\\\"s groundbreaking work in 1822 deciphered the hieroglyphic text on the Rosetta Stone, leading to significant advancements in Egyptology.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Inspired Study Of\",\n      \"Cuneiform\",\n      \"The Rosetta Stone served as a model for the study of cuneiform, contributing to its decipherment and translation.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Inspired Study Of\",\n      \"Linear B\",\n      \"The Rosetta Stone served as a model for the study of Linear B, contributing to its decipherment and translation.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Inspired Study Of\",\n      \"Mayan Hieroglyphs\",\n      \"The Rosetta Stone served as a model for the study of Mayan hieroglyphs, contributing to their decipherment and translation.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Revealed Insights Into\",\n      \"Ancient Egyptian Civilization\",\n      \"The decipherment of hieroglyphs on the Rosetta Stone revealed insights into the religious beliefs, political structures, and daily life of the ancient Egyptians.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Rosetta Stone\",\n      \"Associated With\",\n      \"Napoleon\\\"s Campaign in Egypt\",\n      \"The Rosetta Stone was discovered during Napoleon\\\"s campaign in Egypt, which was a significant historical event that facilitated its study and decipherment.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Napoleo